This project has the goal to improve the abysmal performance of the AGOT mod,}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
this are some of my own ideas on how to optimize many aspects of the game.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5

{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Setup and Compat-}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
This mod can be combined with any other submod combo.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
There are 2 separate mods:}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
1}{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\f5\b
:AGOT_Optimized }{\f5
contains all the base improvements and must be active at game start.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
2:}{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\f5\b
AGOT_Optimized_Continue}{\f5
 improves the late-game performance and might fix a broken save, it should be disabled at game start and activated only after 50-100 years, this is because There are many events that are only relevant at the begining like ageons conquest or danys quest, those events neeed to be evaluated for nothing in the late game, the point of this companion mod is to 'blank' such files when the player reaches the late game to gain some performance.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Also, you can use the continue mod without the optimized mod if you wanted to, it should work on any arbitrary save.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\sb0\sa283\f5

