\par \pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5

{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\f5\b
# Slavery system #}
{\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\ab\dbch\ab\loch\b\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
The main factors against performance in CK2 is the number of characters times number of mtth events + decisions, and also province events...Slavery has all 4 in spades,so this mod removes all slave courtiers, the script to do slave trade, all related decisions, and the slave pit building mainteinance, in its place I tried to build a more efficient, still fun system.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Every decision related to slavery has been removed in favor of just one: manage slaves, when clicked, a menu event provides every option of the system with dynamic tooltips.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Each Slave Owner character has a variable called Number of slaves to track how many slaves they own, Slave Owners recive bonus similar to the slave camp levels of the old system, there are 10 levels of slave economy,each level requires 2k slaves, but for each demnese above 1 a 10% peanlty is applied up to 50%, for example, to get max bonus on 5+ demnese +40k slaves are required.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-New buildings exclusive to slavers.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Sell/Buy Batches of 1k slaves}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Buy 1k slaves for 200-300 gold or sell 1k slaves for 180-280 gold, the prices are randomized but having good diplo, intrigue and specially admin will skew prices in your favor, council stats help too.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
The way it works is that you select buy or sell, then the game makes you an offer, if refused a cooldown of 3 months is imposed after a new price can be rolled, if you accept the deal then the cooldown is of 6 months.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Buy Unsullied}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
This option allows to spawn 500 unsullied for 1600-2000 gold if you have sufficient retinue cap, 1 unsulied=2Rc.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5

{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Slave Raids}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Works like the og system, except that you get a random number of slaves depending on your martial, one of the three events requires your character to be in command of the army on siege won. Ironborn get 25% bonus.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Ai uses a very simplified version of the system so to reduce impact performance, also retinues are off limits for the Ai, so no ai unsullied.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
# Colonization Revised #}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
The og colonization system has a flaw that makes the game engine scan every province for active colonies every so months which is bad, }{\f5
I}{\f5
 removed this event and used a more contained aproach by chaining triggered events to grow the colony, this is how it works in practice:}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
When a colony is started you will see 4 red hammer modifiers in the colony province, after 1-5 years an event will remove one of the modifiers, reflecting the colony growth, then this proces will repeat 7 more times untill the colony is finished, the interval of 1-5y dependss on your admin + steward if supervising in the province, slaves also give a bonus.there is a cheat to advance a colony at will, right-click on the province title shield to use.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
#Submods Integration#}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Some popular submods have been integrated in this project for their impact in performance, the following mods should be disabled when using optimized:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
-Wurzeldieb buildings integration}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
I really like this mod but its an absolute drain for the CPU, the version integrated in this project keeps most of the content but everything under the hood is either new or gone.For some of the old decisions and events, a new 4th option for the going out event has been added.}
{\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql{\f5
Since the slavery system introduces many new buildings for slavers I made the tailor and the Stonemason non-slaver only, the old stonemason/tailor events happen every 10 years as before.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

{\f5\lang1033\par}\pard\plain \s0\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\ltrpar\cf0\kerning1\rtlch\af9\afs24\alang3082\ltrch\hich\af3\afs24\alang3082\dbch\af7\langfe2052\loch\f3\fs24\lang3082\ql\f5\lang1033

